  "diagnosis": "The postcondition '0 <= i < (a.Length) - 1' is too restrictive. The index of the maximum element can legitimately be a.Length - 1 (the last position). The loop invariant guarantees '0 <= j < a.Length', and after 'i := j', Dafny can only prove '0 <= i < a.Length', not the stricter 'i < a.Length - 1'. The bridge from invariant to postcondition fails because j (and hence i) may equal a.Length - 1.",
  "repair": "ensures 0 <= i < a.Length"
}
